  {
   "address": 32808,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Starts the level: stops the music, turns off CIA 1's interrupts (so no tune plays), blanks the bitmap, points the raster call at $81AB and sets the VIC-II from the list after the call."
  },
  {
   "address": 32843,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "vic_inline_writes's list, register and value: $D021=$0C, $D015=$00, $D010=$00, $D011=$3B, $D016=$08, $D012=$0A, $D020=$00, $D01B=$00, $D018=$79, $D019=$FF, $D01A=$81, $D001=$FA, $D003=$FA, $D005=$FA, $D007=$FA, $D009=$FA, $D00B=$FA, $D00D=$FA, $D00F=$FA; $FF ends it."
  },
  {
   "address": 32882,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Clears the workspace, screen, colour and bitmap, selects VIC-II bank 1 and unpacks the picture (screen at $5C00, bitmap at $6000) from $E000, then sets up the lanes (lanes_init)."
  },
  {
   "address": 32896,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The JSR's operand; named by a stale reference."
  },
  {
   "address": 32908,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The JSR's high byte."
  },
  {
   "address": 32909,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "unpack_inline's arguments: the packed data at $E000 ($E000), 4577 bytes long."
  },
  {
   "address": 32911,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The packed picture's length."
  },
  {
   "address": 32913,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sets up the marine, the lanes and the sprites."
  },
  {
   "address": 32925,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Once a frame, unless paused or over ($067B): moves the aliens, animates them, moves the marine and his flame, finds his lane, burns or pushes back the aliens there, counts the marines, the alien going for a marine, the fuse, the lane timers, the speeds, the score digits, new aliens, the alien dropping from the ceiling and the heartbeat."
  },
  {
   "address": 33000,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "One byte between the loop's JMP and heartbeat that nothing runs."
  },
  {
   "address": 33001,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Every five ticks of $020B, $0661 goes up by one (to 22 at most), and the heartbeat sound beats faster: its gap is $36 less twice $0661."
  },
  {
   "address": 33051,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The raster call at the top: the alien dropping from the ceiling (sprites 6 and 7), the flame (sprite 2) and the marine (sprite 3), then the lanes' raster calls from line $30."
  },
  {
   "address": 33081,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside raster_top: the trainer pokes $8139 when it loads level 6, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33082,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside raster_top: the trainer pokes $813A when it loads level 6, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33083,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside raster_top: the trainer pokes $813B when it loads level 6, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33144,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside raster_top: the trainer pokes $8178 when it loads level 4, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33195,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "For each lane, top to bottom: the upper halves of its two aliens (sprites 0 and 1), at their x and frames."
  },
  {
   "address": 33261,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Six lines on: the lower halves (sprites 4 and 5), six pixels left of the upper halves except while the alien burns. Then the next lane, $0E lines further down, or the bottom row after the last."
  },
  {
   "address": 33348,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "After the last lane the raster call goes to line $AC (raster_bottom)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33364,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At line $B3: the marines still alive as a row of figures (sprites 0-6) and the alien going for them (sprite 7), then the fuse's spark."
  },
  {
   "address": 33539,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At line $D0: the fuse's spark (sprite 0) at its place along the fuse, flickering white and red."
  },
  {
   "address": 33639,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The next call at line $F8 (raster_frame)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33655,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "At line $F8: level_frame, then the first raster call of the next frame."
  },
  {
   "address": 33692,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Named by the trainer of level 1, which lies here when it is loaded."
  },
  {
   "address": 33693,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside raster_frame: the trainer pokes $839D when it loads level 1, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33694,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Inside raster_frame: the trainer pokes $839E when it loads level 1, whose own code lies here then."
  },
  {
   "address": 33704,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The spark's y for each of the fuse's 40 steps."
  },
  {
   "address": 33744,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The spark's x for each of the fuse's 40 steps."
  },
  {
   "address": 33784,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The fuse: the spark moves to step $0675, and the fuse's next byte is drawn away in the bitmap (the address from fuse_addr, the byte from fuse_bytes, written into the STA at $8419). Every three ticks of $020B it burns one step on; at step 39 the level is won."
  },
  {
   "address": 33818,
