  },
  {
   "address": 33978,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "When aliens have got past the marine ($066D) and none is on its way, the alien at the bottom sets off for the marines ($066E bit 7)."
  },
  {
   "address": 33994,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The alien walks left along the bottom ($066C) until it reaches the last marine in the row (grab_x by the marines alive). It takes him (grab_marine) and walks back to $C0; then one alien fewer has got past. With one marine left, it takes him and the level is lost: $0203 = 0 and stage_complete."
