   "text": "The eight bits of the marines byte."
  },
  {
   "address": 34114,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each empty lane, when its timer has run, gets new aliens: one, then the other, then both (spawn_mask), coming in from the left. After the third wave the lane's aliens drop from the ceiling instead (drop_start)."
  },
  {
   "address": 34187,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Which aliens a lane's waves bring: a, b, then both."
  },
  {
   "address": 34190,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "An alien drops from the ceiling into the lane: sfx_alarm, a pause of 32 frames before the next, a random x, and the y where it lands ($85B8)."
