  {
   "address": 34332,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The burning aliens: each counts down from 7 through the burning frames ($8A0B, $8A0F); at the end it is gone, and an empty lane waits 7 ticks before its next wave."
  },
  {
   "address": 34452,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The flame (sprite 2): a random colour from flame_colours; with fire held it shoots out from the marine and travels left ($04A5 a frame) up to 48 pixels, otherwise it is the idle frame by the gun."
  },
  {
   "address": 34568,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The marine's lane: the one whose y is within $1A of his."
  },
  {
   "address": 34588,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each lane's y."
  },
  {
   "address": 34593,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "In the marine's lane: while the flame is out, an alien within 36 pixels of it starts burning (7); with the flame off, an alien that touches the marine is pushed back the way it came for 20 ticks less $0647, which grows by two with each push (to 12 at most), so each push is shorter."
  },
  {
   "address": 34668,
